"immediate information about false messages in the previous queries."
msgstr ""
"Layanan eksklusif mencegah pengguna mengulang permintaan dan menyediakan\\n"
"informasi segera tentang pesan palsu dalam kueri sebelumnya."

#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:158
msgid ""
"Volunteers would login Cofacts and fact-check the suspicious messages.\n"
"What fact-checkers have replied and commented would be transparent\n"
"and reviewed, the achievement was opened and shareable."
msgstr ""
"Sukarelawan akan masuk ke Cofacts dan memeriksa fakta pesan yang mencurigakan.\\n"
"Apa yang telah dibalas dan dikomentari oleh pemeriksa fakta akan transparan\\n"
"dan ditinjau, pencapaiannya dibuka dan dapat dibagikan."

#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:166
msgid ""
"Cofacts has categorized misinformation via topics automatically, making\n"
"different expertise focus on their professional fields. Such as COVID-19,\n"
"Vaccine related, propaganda, public policy, or fraud, these could be\n"
"categorized by Artificial Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Cofacts telah mengkategorikan disinformasi secara otomatis melalui topik, sehingga\\n"
"keahlian berbeda dapat fokus pada bidang profesional mereka. Misalnya COVID-19,\\n"
"berkaitan dengan vaksin, propaganda, kebijakan publik, atau penipuan, hal-hal ini dapat\\n"
"dikategorikan oleh Kecerdasan Buatan."

#: components/ReportPage/SectionFeatures.js:174
msgid ""
"Cofacts has provided API connecting instruction, fact-checking system\n"
"since 2016. This achievement leads the combating misinformation ecosystem.\n"
"There were third party chatbots connecting to Cofacts open API and IFCN\n"
"member started to conduct own chatbots."
msgstr ""
"Cofacts telah menyediakan instruksi koneksi API, sistem cek fakta\\n"
"sejak tahun 2016. Pencapaian ini memimpin ekosistem penanggulangan disinformasi.\\n"
"Ada chatbot pihak ketiga yang terhubung ke API terbuka Cofacts dan anggota IFCN\\n"
"mulai menjalankan chatbot mereka sendiri."

